ants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Crwv3yAmCFweHFKQJJez5w","review_id":"6LdcVYE9EWkVTHHDUv3Xkw","date":"2021-05-06T16:00:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9224452972412109,"text_excerpt":"Great spot. I wanted to try the food because it looked and smelled so good but we were just here for drinks and music. The band was awesome. Their name easy name of the guy's happy little band or something like that lol. Very talented. Great vibes. Will visit again if I'm ever in New Orleans."},{"business_id":"Crwv3yAmCFweHFKQJJez5w","review_id":"qZqwZLSCE-gM4xAxvUqcLg","date":"2018-01-16T21:56:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.919894814491272,"text_excerpt":"This is a somewhat strange venue as far as layout - there is a well lit bar and then a hallway and a more nightclub themed room and another bar behind the first one. The bartender was talkative and recommended food and drink and told about stories of her travels and her work at other establishments. Talked to a few of the customers that came in and out here, and it definitely was a friendly crowd. And later a very drunk (but still friendly) crowd. I had a good time here - maybe not the top notch food you might find in New Orleans but a fun place anyway."},{"business_id":"Crwv3yAmCFweHFKQJJez5w","review_id":"bIl8RLZuPejd4t9-5MWT4g","date":"2020-04-15T07:46:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9192383289337158,"text_excerpt":"Definitely come here if you're on Frenchman Street. No cover charge to get in. Me and my girls were looking for hip hop/Spanish music which caught our attention when we walked by. It was pretty packed which is what drew us inside. The drink prices weren't crazy either but being from NYC i'm used to steep prices. It has a huge open space which is perfect for dancing. There's also a stage where the DJ was placed since there was no live music. It has a really chill atmosphere overall and I enjoyed myself. We actually left to walk around and see if anything else was poppin but ended up coming back! I was here during my trip to NOLA in August so it was still warm outside and the doors were ope..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Crwv3yAmCFweHFKQJJez5w","photo_id":"Nso4ymYksaOBhNcvVTDcKg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Nso4ymYksaOBhNcvVTDcKg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9019637107849121},{"business_id":"Crwv3yAmCFweHFKQJJez5w","photo_id":"ay2LgDo5hop_Z8GXDLyGqA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ay2LgDo5hop_Z8GXDLyGqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8785659074783325},{"business_id":"Crwv3yAmCFweHFKQJJez5w","photo_id":"Z3wHxOS-5qLOKr-mIUOfpQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Z3wHxOS-5qLOKr-mIUOfpQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8689059615135193},{"business_id":"Crwv3yAmCFweHFKQJJez5w","photo_id":"X9andhvdNo2grVEXEJY54A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/X9andhvdNo2grVEXEJY54A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8315391540527344},{"business_id":"Crwv3yAmCFweHFKQJJez5w","photo_id":"8dP6OjnzRLf5T1ntQSf4vA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8dP6OjnzRLf5T1ntQSf4vA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7016706466674805}]},"notebook_case":null}
